WEBVTT

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.640
I don't want to! No!

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.100
No!

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.150
He serves at my side.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:47.650
Kun-kun! Kun-kun! Kun-kun!

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:49.650
You're my servant.
 Give him up.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.320
I don't want to!

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:52.320
Enough.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.370
You two...

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:12.610
W-What was that?

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:16.620
Jun-kun!

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.610
What was that noise just now?

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:22.200
Could it be a thief...

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.630
That so hurt.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:40.920
Suiseiseki?

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:47.440
Shinku...

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:52.860
Shinku, I missed you so...

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.310
Hina too! Hina too!

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:57.320
I missed you so!

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.430
Shinku! Shinku!

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:02.220
Shinku! Shinku!

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:04.610
Another new doll...

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.330
Shinku!

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:13.330
Suiseiseki

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:18.500
Please, help yourselves.

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:21.860
You're more than welcome.

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:23.370
Hey, Seaweed Nori.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:27.250
You're way too accommodating.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.520
We're saddled with another troublemaker.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.780
W-What?

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:39.680
Hey, who did you get 
wound by, Suiseiseki?

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:43.930
And what about her?

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:49.420
Who's "her"?

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:51.100
There's more?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.570
Sounds fun, Jun-kun.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.370
You know...

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:57.170
Humans are so...

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.350
I just hate humans so!

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:10.110
Suiseiseki-chan.

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.320
Bad!

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:17.130
You shouldn't play with your food.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.540
I guess you don't like sponge cake.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:32.180
Strawberries with condensed milk?

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:33.340
Strawberries!

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:42.480
As a gardener, it isn't like you
to lump all humans together.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.740
Did something happen?

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:53.400
Hey.

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:56.510
What?

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:59.150
It's already time to go to sleep.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.740
If you're going to sleep,
do something about this first.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.300
You needn't worry.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.910
The wind won't reach inside the case.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.020
Worry about me!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.150
Good night.

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:15.620
Hey.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:17.520
Good night!

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:22.840
Talk about living in 
a world of her own...

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:28.430
W-What?

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:32.500
Chibi.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:33.350
Chi...

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:39.100
I get the feeling this one's
going to be a lot of trouble.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.680
What was that just now?

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.440
Was that you?

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:08.630
Stay on that side of the line.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.700
Um... Um...

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:15.240
Crawl back to your sleeping place
and don't come out.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.270
Got that?

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:18.740
What was that?

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:21.920
He moved!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:23.380
Hold still, you!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.350
Stay away!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.080
What's this ruckus?

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.340
Help me, Shinku!

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:36.290
Jun, don't scare her too much.

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:41.030
Even among the sisters,
she's particularly timid and shy.

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:43.010
H-How do you figure?

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:44.930
How filthy!

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.400
Don't spit, you!

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.400
Hold it!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:53.210
Hina wants to play tag too!

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.280
Let go! 
I said let go!

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:58.480
Hey, where'd you go?

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:02.510
Really, what a persistent bastard.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:10.580
Is this garden yours?

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:16.050
Yes, my own version.

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:18.070
They've been overfertilized.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:23.340
It's nice that you pamper them,
but they say they're full.

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:27.830
Wow, so you can talk to flowers?

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:28.990
There.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.270
What?

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:32.560
Calm down.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:36.430
This may be an unexpected 
boon for you, Jun.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.490
The powers of the gardener Suiseiseki.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:41.590
Forget it!

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.960
I don't care what her powers are!

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:49.000
Please do it then, Suiseiseki.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:53.570
Truthfully, I hate to waste 
it on a human, but...

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:00.300
I wonder what's about to start.

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.520
It's so exciting.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.280
Sui Dream.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:26.530
Open the door.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.940
You're finally awake.

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:35.730
Really, what a troublesome bastard.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:38.710
Hey, you!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.610
What a hopelessly gloomy world.

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:50.480
It makes me want to puke.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.190
You brought us.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:56.200
You should know this 
world better than me.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:58.600
This is your dream.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:02.630
A world reflecting what's in your heart.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.740
This is...

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:06.750
my...

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.210
You're really sure he's okay?

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:13.180
Don't worry.

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:17.970
Suiseiseki's power finds
and crosses the door to dreams.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:19.220
But...

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:27.940
I'll check on them.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.220
Hina too.

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:30.730
M-Me too.

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.670
Aren't you afraid?

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.130
But...

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:40.440
If it helps me understand his heart
even a little better...

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.960
You wait here.

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:48.950
Wait for us!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:50.850
Shinku-chan...

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:57.960
<i>He will likely not want 
you to see him right now.</i>

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:22.520
You're kidding, right?

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:24.840
This is my dream?

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:28.840
One, x, slash, one, x is...

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:30.450
Shinku!

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.460
I'm so glad.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:40.230
I was at a loss being alone with him.

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:42.290
That's my line.

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:43.230
Hey, hey.

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:45.240
Look, look.

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:49.340
Textbook Search
6th Grade Math

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.340
Study guides.

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:52.240
So many!

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:09.890
Jun Sakurada

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:12.220
The runt's name.

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:25.410
<i>In your seats, quickly.</i>

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.910
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.080
<i>Sakurada's out again?</i>

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.540
<i>Really?</i>

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:38.040
<i>I wonder what happened...</i>

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:48.080
Wow, the flowers are talking!

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:49.560
Isn't that interesting?

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.300
Hey.

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:58.040
Would Nori like some of these flowers?

00:11:58.300 --> 00:11:59.810
<i>W-Who's she?</i>

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:00.970
<i>Don't, stupid. Stay away!</i>

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.980
Yes... Why not?

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:55.790
Hina-Ichigo,
 it went your way!

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:57.300
Okay!

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:05.770
Damn it.

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:08.510
How ludicrous he looks.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:12.010
What's fun about chasing minicars?

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.410
If he's capable of such expressions...

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:33.600
What's that?

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:39.100
Jun.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:45.870
Really, even your courage is mini sized.

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:49.200
Why are you flying?

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.650
You're the only one who can't.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:53.080
What?

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:57.950
You'll always be a runt since
you gauge against puny standards.

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.930
W-What is this?

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:30.320
Fly.

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.010
This is your world.

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:37.890
If you wish to fly, 
you can.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.370
Hurry.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:48.570
What are you waiting for, Chibi?

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.680
You rotten doll...

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:57.580
Quit calling me a chibi!

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:24.780
Ow...

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:27.370
You did well for a runt.

00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:33.170
Of course.

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:35.150
A monster like that
made out of paper...

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:36.580
True.

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:38.930
That is just paper.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:47.560
Math (Part 1)
Name ( Jun Sakurada )

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.170
Wow, so pretty!

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:57.800
This is excellent, 
given this world.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:01.470
What's pretty?

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:04.960
What's pretty about a world like this?

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.500
Take a look.

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:23.580
We're going there, Jun.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:28.100
Cross quickly, you.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:30.300
Why don't you fly now?

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:33.940
H-Hey...

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:42.490
A very small tree.

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:45.190
Its shape is awfully warped.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.750
This tiny tree is you.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.110
Everyone has a tree in their dreams.

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:55.190
Dreamers grow branches and leaves...

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:58.500
...and their spirit develops 
through this process.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:00.600
This tree is me?

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:04.190
But this one's growth
 is being stunted.

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:07.740
We could prune these
if we had the gardener's shears.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.970
Gardener's shears?

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:20.620
Sorry, this is all I can do right now.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.040
Sui Dream.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:41.670
Fill my watering can.

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:44.600
Fill it with sweet water.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.650
Be healthy... Be free...

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.150
Unfurl your shimmering, green leaves...

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:14.320
No good.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.780
It can't grow more,
blocked by surrounding grass.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:20.670
But it perked up a bit.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:24.050
I'm so sorry, tiny tree.

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:24.870
It's fine.

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:26.660
Don't apologize so much.

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:30.220
I'm not saying it to you!

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:32.240
Know thyself, you!

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:34.190
What's that, you rotten doll?

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:36.080
What?

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.770
You'll be fine now, right?

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:38.530
You're forgetting 
your place, you runt!

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:41.330
After all, you have someone
to provide both light and water.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.390
"Runt" again?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.310
Quit calling me that already!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:45.400
What's wrong with
calling a runt a runt?

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:46.180
The rest will be up to 
your own will to live.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:50.060
Why are you and Shinku staying
with a runt like this?

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:51.340
Like I know!

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:52.790
It's a nuisance too!

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:54.400
Especially with a rotten doll like you!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.970
It's almost time.

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:00.590
If we wind down here,

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:03.180
we'll be trapped
in the dream world forever.

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:04.970
That'd be great.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.690
So you'd be gone 
when I woke up?

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:11.610
If so, you'd be trapped 
in this dream too.

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:14.770
In real-world terms,
you'd become a living corpse.

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:17.680
Y-You should say so sooner!

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:19.260
You didn't ask.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.700
Hey, we're going back.

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:23.960
We do not know the way back.

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:25.200
Don't know?

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:27.750
Have you forgotten?

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:31.180
This is your world.

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:37.470
Hold on.

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.300
You're going too fast.

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:40.720
I'm going to fall!

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:43.620
Man, all these complaints!

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:48.660
What are you doing?

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:50.770
Hang on tight!

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:03.790
Ow...

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.500
Jun-kun, you're all right!

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:07.880
Don't latch on!

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:09.830
But...

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.880
You certainly took us 
for a frightening ride.

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:16.790
We're back, Nori.

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:18.390
We're back!

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.960
I'm exhausted.

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:25.530
I'm glad you all made it back safely.

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:28.320
You've got to be kidding me.

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:30.080
Suiseiseki.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:34.770
How about entering a 
covenant with Jun too?

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:36.600
H-Hold on.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:38.660
What are you saying?

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:40.620
He is my servant.

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:43.880
He has faults but isn't a bad human.

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:46.140
Like I just said...

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:48.850
Two or three makes no difference.

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:50.850
How's that no diff...

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:56.300
Um, well...

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:02.400
I'd rather die than be 
with the likes of you!

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.150
I wouldn't want you either!

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:08.470
He's barking!

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:11.040
You rotten doll, hold it!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.380
The runt is chasing me!

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:13.380
Say "ah..."

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:16.240
I said not to call me a runt!

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:15.380
Ah!

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.700
Nori, it's yummy.

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:19.380
Runt! Runt! Runt! Runt! Runt! Runt!

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:18.860
Really?

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:19.760
Yeah!

00:23:41.920 --> 00:23:44.400
I can't stand any more.

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:45.420
What's wrong?

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:46.920
What's wrong?

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:50.320
The chibi human
and chibi Ichigo are being mean!

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:52.130
That's unreasonable.

00:23:52.130 --> 00:23:56.380
They're framing me for things
and soiling my case.

00:23:56.540 --> 00:23:59.820
They must not like the newcomer.

00:23:59.980 --> 00:24:02.710
If so, it's all-out war!

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:04.860
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:05.060 --> 00:24:07.520
Swear upon this rose ring.

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:10.950
Chapter 5
Stairs
